Original work
-------------

`svg/generic.svg` is an original work authored for homemedia-portal. It is not
part of the Dashboard Icons project and carries no third-party rights. It is the
neutral fallback used whenever a requested icon id is unknown.

`svg/watch.svg`, `svg/request.svg`, `svg/download.svg`, `svg/settings.svg`, and
`svg/activity.svg` are likewise original works authored for homemedia-portal
(feature 002). They are neutral role glyphs — not brand marks — and carry no
third-party rights. See PROVENANCE.md.
